            "id": 146437,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Let's learn how to wrap game UI text around a sprite image like in the screen below.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;!-- &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;style.css&quot;&gt; --&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   img {&#xA;    width: 30%;&#xA;    float: right;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/bitcoin.png&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h4&gt;Quest Update&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Collect 3 keys to unlock the next level. Watch out for roaming enemies.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Tip: use your shield when your health is low to avoid taking damage.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146438,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
